    "M. & I rode over to find",
    "the Lake; we found it,",
    "and caught about",
    "fifty trout, but only",
    "by ~~after~~ four hours",
    "riding and six",
    "hours as hard walking",
    "as I ever had. Pretty",
    "tired, and glad to",
    "get back to camp",
    "and a first class",
    "trout supper"
